window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-013-c397ed96e195199d.json"]={sha256:"c397ed96e195199d5df4a174e94556d758cc3f28bc68eb4d4ddc77ede568ce79",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-6409ad9cf5592911","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8879.html","title":"RFC 8879: TLS Certificate Compression","titleEn":"RFC 8879: TLS Certificate Compression","publisher":"IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-013","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-013","related":[{"id":"security-v27-014","referenceUrls":["https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446.html"],"title":"TLS 1.3：早期資料的重播語意與業務准入","titleEn":"TLS 1.3: early-data replay semantics and operation admission","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：5與6倍可重算，所有長度及演算法負例均失敗；驗收文件不把低壓縮比等同安全憑證。 交付compression-contract.csv、資源預算及解壓/憑證驗證的分層結果；所有壓縮材料可由同一種子重建。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reproduce ratios of 5 and 6 and reject every length or negotiation counterexample. Acceptance does not equate a small expansion ratio with a trustworthy certificate. Deliver compression-contract.csv, the resource budget and separate decompression/certificate results. Every compressed fixture must be reproducible from the recorded local seed.","difference":"建立20筆操作表，欄位包括方法、路徑類型、副作用、驗證狀態及是否允許早期資料；GET方法只是線索，必須檢查實際業務語意。","differenceEn":"Build 20 operation rows with method, route class, side effects, authentication state and early-data eligibility. Treat GET as a clue rather than a proof: an endpoint with hidden state changes remains unsuitable for the local read-only rule.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["解壓後須與宣告未壓縮長度一致；本課另設16000位元組資源上限，計算輸出相對輸入的放大率。此上限是實驗選擇，不是RFC固定最大值。 壓縮輸入2400位元組，宣告及實際輸出皆12000位元組；記錄演算法識別、客戶端廣告清單及解壓終止原因。 放大率12000/2400=5倍；維持輸入而輸出改14400位元組時為6倍，兩者都仍低於16000位元組本地上限。","本課採保守規則：只有已確認無狀態變更且可容忍重播的操作能使用早期資料；不合格者延後至握手完成，不等於永久拒絕業務請求。 20種操作中12種通過語意審查；另8種包含計數器、狀態寫入或一次性動作，均從早期資料集合排除。 可准入比例12/20×100=60%；重新確認其中3種其實會寫入後，只餘9種，比例45%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Decompressed size must agree with the declared uncompressed length. The exercise additionally selects a 16000-byte resource limit and measures output-to-input expansion; this local limit is not presented as a fixed RFC maximum. Use a 2400-byte compressed input with both declared and actual output of 12000 bytes. Record algorithm identifier, the client advertisement and termination reason so that negotiation failure cannot be mistaken for decompressor failure. Expansion is 12000/2400=5 times. Holding input size fixed while changing output to 14400 gives 6 times; both remain below the local byte limit, but neither ratio proves the reconstructed certificate is trusted.","The local conservative rule admits early data only for operations confirmed to be replay-tolerant and free of state changes. Others wait until handshake completion; delaying early execution does not permanently deny the underlying business operation. Of 20 operation types, 12 pass the semantic review. Eight involve counters, writes or one-time actions and are excluded from early execution. Counts describe operation types, not observed traffic frequency or latency savings. Eligible proportion is 12/20×100=60 percent. Discovering hidden writes in three previously accepted types leaves nine, or 45 percent. The denominator stays fixed because no route was added or removed.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-023","referenceUrls":["https://research.google/pubs/zanzibar-googles-consistent-global-authorization-system/"],"title":"Zanzibar：撤權事件與內容讀取的一致性界線","titleEn":"Zanzibar: revocation ordering and content-read consistency","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：5與6倍可重算，所有長度及演算法負例均失敗；驗收文件不把低壓縮比等同安全憑證。 交付compression-contract.csv、資源預算及解壓/憑證驗證的分層結果；所有壓縮材料可由同一種子重建。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reproduce ratios of 5 and 6 and reject every length or negotiation counterexample. Acceptance does not equate a small expansion ratio with a trustworthy certificate. Deliver compression-contract.csv, the resource budget and separate decompression/certificate results. Every compressed fixture must be reproducible from the recorded local seed.","difference":"列出授權修訂、內容修訂、檢查快照與依賴方要求的最低版本；建立先撤權後更新內容的事件圖，逐筆標出可見順序。","differenceEn":"Record authorization revision, content revision, check snapshot and the relying-party minimum revision. Draw a revoke-then-content-update timeline and mark visibility for each request, distinguishing causal ordering from wall-clock coincidence.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["解壓後須與宣告未壓縮長度一致；本課另設16000位元組資源上限，計算輸出相對輸入的放大率。此上限是實驗選擇，不是RFC固定最大值。 壓縮輸入2400位元組，宣告及實際輸出皆12000位元組；記錄演算法識別、客戶端廣告清單及解壓終止原因。 放大率12000/2400=5倍；維持輸入而輸出改14400位元組時為6倍，兩者都仍低於16000位元組本地上限。","本地模型要求檢查快照不舊於指定修訂；不足者等待或回報不可判定。等待缺口為max(0,要求版本−已見版本)，它不是時間延遲測量。 內容讀取要求至少修訂105，快取只見101；另保留修訂100的舊允許與105的撤權結果，清楚標示不能混用。 落後max(0,105−101)=4個修訂；快取推進至104後仍落後1，不能因接近而當成已符合。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Decompressed size must agree with the declared uncompressed length. The exercise additionally selects a 16000-byte resource limit and measures output-to-input expansion; this local limit is not presented as a fixed RFC maximum. Use a 2400-byte compressed input with both declared and actual output of 12000 bytes. Record algorithm identifier, the client advertisement and termination reason so that negotiation failure cannot be mistaken for decompressor failure. Expansion is 12000/2400=5 times. Holding input size fixed while changing output to 14400 gives 6 times; both remain below the local byte limit, but neither ratio proves the reconstructed certificate is trusted.","The local model requires an authorization snapshot at least as new as a specified revision. An older snapshot waits or yields unavailable. Its gap is max(0,required−observed), a revision count rather than a measured time delay. A content read requires revision 105 while the cache has observed 101. Retain an old allow at revision 100 and a revocation at 105, explicitly showing that a valid old decision cannot satisfy the newer consistency requirement. The gap is max(0, 105−101)=4 revisions. Advancing the cache to 104 leaves one revision outstanding; being close does not satisfy the requested consistency boundary.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-e28608fb71a795c2","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446.html","title":"RFC 8446: TLS 1.3","titleEn":"RFC 8446: TLS 1.3","publisher":"IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-173a08fbfede3bc2","url":"https://research.google/pubs/zanzibar-googles-consistent-global-authorization-system/","title":"Zanzibar: Google’s Consistent, Global Authorization System","titleEn":"Zanzibar: Google’s Consistent, Global Authorization System","publisher":"Google Research / USENIX ATC 2019","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
